A breakable source of reflection could be useful in the early game.
Consider the gnome with the wand of death.
For a careful player this shield could last until a permanent source
of reflection was acquired; for the non-careful player it wouldn't
last long at all.  It sounds like a fine idea to me although I'd say
make it exactly like a mirror and have it break with a 50% on any
physical hit or near miss, or when hit by a force bolt.

Or, maybe instead just allow mirrors to be worn in the shield slot and
allow a wielded mirror to give reflection.


